WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.044
- But when I was a kid,

00:00:01.044 --> 00:00:04.530
I was a different kind of person.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:06.900
Like I was one of those kids

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.944
who stole candy from little kids and--

00:00:09.944 --> 00:00:11.820
(audience gasps)

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:12.653
- Wait, what?

00:00:12.653 --> 00:00:15.360
- Are you judging me? Are you judging?

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.755
- Yes. Wait, you're like
the nicest guy ever.

00:00:17.755 --> 00:00:20.970
- But, where I grew up,
like it happened to me

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.394
and so when I got older--

00:00:22.394 --> 00:00:23.322
- [Kelly] Oh it's like a right of passage.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:24.360
- It's a right of passage.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.500
You know what I mean?
Someone stole your candy.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.090
- [Kelly] No, that's a
really nice justification.

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.060
- Yeah.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:29.528
(laughter)

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:31.324
- That's beautiful. Yeah.

00:00:31.324 --> 00:00:33.330
And everyone was doing it y'all.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:35.190
- Everyone was doing
it. It happened to me.

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.175
So I kept this vicious cycle.

00:00:36.175 --> 00:00:37.324
- [Kelly] People would just
walk up and take your candy?

00:00:37.324 --> 00:00:39.330
- Yeah. It was like bigger kids.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.233
Like this was like when ET was out.

00:00:41.233 --> 00:00:42.066
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:42.066 --> 00:00:42.899
- So it was different.

00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:44.730
It was like someone said,
Hey kid, gimme your candy.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.608
- Yeah.

00:00:45.608 --> 00:00:47.113
- You were like this.

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:47.946
- Yeah.

00:00:47.946 --> 00:00:49.440
- And you give it to
him and then, you know

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.090
Cause you didn't wanna get
beat up and so you give it

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.250
to him and then you just go get some more.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.138
- Yeah.

00:00:54.138 --> 00:00:54.971
- You gonna get some more.

00:00:54.971 --> 00:00:55.804
So when you got older, you
said, Yeah, go get some more.

00:00:55.804 --> 00:00:57.300
You'll be all right. You'll be all right.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.133
Go get some more.

00:00:58.133 --> 00:00:59.040
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:00:59.873
- Yeah.

00:00:59.873 --> 00:01:00.810
Makes them tough.

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.127
- I would-- see, I'm sneaky
though, like as a parent

00:01:03.127 --> 00:01:05.610
so I can't really judge
you because I totally

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.596
steal their candy while they're sleeping.

00:01:07.596 --> 00:01:08.429
(laughing)

00:01:08.429 --> 00:01:09.262
They go to bed.

00:01:09.262 --> 00:01:10.095
- Yeah.

00:01:10.095 --> 00:01:11.250
- Yeah. And I'm like, I
find my favorite things.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.690
And I'm like, Yeah, that's mine.

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:13.523
And they won't remember.

00:01:13.523 --> 00:01:14.356
I'll be like, Oh, I don't know.

00:01:14.356 --> 00:01:15.937
I guess you didn't get that.

00:01:15.937 --> 00:01:18.177
I guess that didn't make it to the bag.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:22.671
- I lie or I act as best as I can.

00:01:22.671 --> 00:01:24.540
(laughing)

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:27.030
As best as I can on Halloween night.

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:28.680
I'm like, Okay kids. It's great.

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:30.300
You got your candy. This is wonderful.

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.409
Listen, you got a big
day tomorrow at school.

00:01:32.409 --> 00:01:34.528
So we can't eat all of this candy now.

00:01:34.528 --> 00:01:35.880
Just give it to me.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.220
You guys go to bed and it'll
be here in the morning.

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.660
You can take little pieces every day

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:40.493
moving forward.

00:01:40.493 --> 00:01:41.326
- That's what we do.

00:01:41.326 --> 00:01:42.159
Yeah. That's what I do now.

00:01:42.159 --> 00:01:43.350
- Them cats go to sleep.

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:47.580
I sit on the couch, I
start combing through.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.413
- You're like, Ooh, I haven't had

00:01:48.413 --> 00:01:49.380
a bit-o-honey in a minute.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:52.800
- I get all of the
Reese's Cups that I can.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:53.633
- I love Reese's

00:01:53.633 --> 00:01:55.740
- And I like leave like
one or two in there

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.510
in their baskets so they don't feel like

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:58.350
- [Kelly] They don't know.

00:01:58.350 --> 00:01:59.430
- That they've been stolen.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.440
- They're not that smart yet. Yeah.

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:03.420
- So I put those in the freezer

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.040
and I hide them in a
special spot in the freezer.

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.380
- In the freezer?

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.300
- [Guest] Yeah. You don't
freeze your Reese's cups?

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.430
- I have not. I freeze grapes.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.660
I love frozen grapes.

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:13.493
- [Guest] That's good.

00:02:13.493 --> 00:02:14.490
- Or frozen Ding Dongs.

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:15.323
- Yeah.

00:02:15.323 --> 00:02:16.156
- I haven't done that in a minute.

00:02:16.156 --> 00:02:16.989
Like since my 20s. But, like, that's good.

00:02:16.989 --> 00:02:17.822
- What about Oreos?

00:02:17.822 --> 00:02:19.981
- See, Oreo is good any time.

00:02:19.981 --> 00:02:21.162
Anytime. Like warm, frozen.

00:02:21.162 --> 00:02:22.457
- Frozen. Frozen is insane.

00:02:22.457 --> 00:02:24.521
- Do you do the chocolate
covered ones too?

00:02:24.521 --> 00:02:25.354
- Yeah.

00:02:25.354 --> 00:02:26.387
- Hey. Yeah.

00:02:26.387 --> 00:02:27.750
(laughter)

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.891
It feels good.

00:02:28.891 --> 00:02:31.900
- Yeah. No, it's just happy time.

